  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "Emma",
      "stars": 5,
      "text": "This salon is incredibly cute and girly. The aesthetic is perfect if you want a girly and relaxed pamper day. I was very impressed with both Janette and Joséphine who did my nails.… Josephine is an expert at what she does. My French manicure is perfect.…",
      "source_ref": "https://www.google.com/maps/place/JOS%C3%89PHINE+NAILS+Dubai/@25.1855143,55.2815535,17z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x3e5f69ec94700535:0xffeacd3287bd21a4"
    },
    {
      "author": "Klementina B.",
      "stars": 5,
      "text": "I’ve visited several nail salons in Dubai, but this one stands out as the best by far! The balance between price and quality is truly exceptional. The team has a great attitude, their work is meticulous, and the salon itself is stunningly well-decorated.…",
      "source_ref": "https://www.google.com/maps/place/JOS%C3%89PHINE+NAILS+Dubai/@25.1855143,55.2815535,17z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x3e5f69ec94700535:0xffeacd3287bd21a4"
    },
    {
      "author": "Wioleta K.",
      "stars": 5,
      "text": "I've been visiting Josephine Nails for almost 2 years now and I have to say, Josephine has become more than just a nail expert—she’s a dear friend.… Her team is just as wonderful, consistently delivering amazing manicure and gel nail designs.…",
      "source_ref": "https://www.google.com/maps/place/JOS%C3%89PHINE+NAILS+Dubai/@25.1855143,55.2815535,17z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x3e5f69ec94700535:0xffeacd3287bd21a4"
    }
  ],
